						<p class="font-semibold text-ink">Book Title Two</p>
						<p class="text-sm text-muted mt-1">Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="flex gap-4 items-start">
					<img src="https://placehold.co/60x90" alt="Book cover" class